OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute after
OL,4,Asupermarket van crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a motorcyclist who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash with a supermarket
OL,8,Fdelivery van have paid tribute to a
OL,9,F"free spirit" who will be missed
OL,10,F"beyond all measure".
OL,12,FPhillip Brough, 46, known as Dean to
OL,13,Fhis family, was riding a Kawasaki
OL,14,Fmotorbike when he was involved in a
OL,15,Fcollision at the junction of Deakin
OL,16,FRoad and Chell Heath Road in
OL,17,FStoke-on-Trent shortly after 16:45 GMT
OL,18,Fon 13 November.
OL,20,FDespite the efforts of emergency
OL,21,Fservices, he died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
