OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute after
OL,4,Asupermarket van crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement issued through
OL,7,FStaffordshire Police, his family said
OL,8,Fhe would be "forever remembered as a
OL,9,Ffree spirit and a treasured son,
OL,10,Ffather, brother, uncle and taid
OL,11,F[grandfather]".
